  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-1-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=x\\,|x-2|\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Estudia la derivabilidad de \\(f\\) en \\(x=2\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y el eje de abscisas."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}x(2-x)=2x-x^2&\\text{si }x\\lt2\\\\x(x-2)=x^2-2x&\\text{si }x\\geq2\\end{cases}\\]<p><b>Continuidad en </b>\\(x=2\\)<b>:</b> los dos trozos valen \\(0\\) en \\(x=2\\), así que \\(f\\) es continua.</p><p><b>Derivadas laterales:</b> \\(f'(x)=2-2x\\) si \\(x\\lt2\\) y \\(f'(x)=2x-2\\) si \\(x\\gt2\\):</p>\\[f'(2^-)=2-4=-2,\\qquad f'(2^+)=4-2=2\\]<div class='res'>\\(f\\) no es derivable en \\(x=2\\) (las derivadas laterales son distintas: hay un punto anguloso)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Para \\(x\\lt2\\) es la parábola \\(2x-x^2\\), con vértice en \\((1,1)\\) y cortes con el eje en \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=2\\). Para \\(x\\geq2\\) es la parábola \\(x^2-2x\\), creciente.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='76.5,126.7 79.3,123.4 82.2,120.3 85.0,117.4 87.8,114.7 90.7,112.1 93.5,109.7 96.3,107.4 99.1,105.3 102.0,103.4 104.8,101.7 107.6,100.1 110.4,98.7 113.3,97.4 116.1,96.3 118.9,95.4 121.7,94.7 124.6,94.1 127.4,93.7 130.2,93.4 133.0,93.3 135.9,93.4 138.7,93.7 141.5,94.1 144.3,94.7 147.2,95.4 150.0,96.3 152.8,97.4 155.7,98.7 158.5,100.1 161.3,101.7 164.1,103.4 167.0,105.3 169.8,107.4 172.6,109.7 175.4,112.1 178.3,114.7 181.1,117.4 183.9,120.3 186.7,123.4 189.6,126.7 189.6,126.7 186.7,126.7 183.9,126.7 181.1,126.7 178.3,126.7 175.4,126.7 172.6,126.7 169.8,126.7 167.0,126.7 164.1,126.7 161.3,126.7 158.5,126.7 155.7,126.7 152.8,126.7 150.0,126.7 147.2,126.7 144.3,126.7 141.5,126.7 138.7,126.7 135.9,126.7 133.0,126.7 130.2,126.7 127.4,126.7 124.6,126.7 121.7,126.7 118.9,126.7 116.1,126.7 113.3,126.7 110.4,126.7 107.6,126.7 104.8,126.7 102.0,126.7 99.1,126.7 96.3,126.7 93.5,126.7 90.7,126.7 87.8,126.7 85.0,126.7 82.2,126.7 79.3,126.7 76.5,126.7' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='31.3,201.3 33.3,197.2 35.3,193.1 37.2,189.1 39.2,185.2 41.2,181.4 43.2,177.6 45.2,173.9 47.1,170.3 49.1,166.8 51.1,163.4 53.1,160.1 55.0,156.8 57.0,153.6 59.0,150.5 61.0,147.5 63.0,144.6 64.9,141.7 66.9,139.0 68.9,136.3 70.9,133.7 72.8,131.1 74.8,128.7 76.8,126.3 78.8,124.1 80.8,121.9 82.7,119.7 84.7,117.7 86.7,115.7 88.7,113.9 90.7,112.1 92.6,110.4 94.6,108.7 96.6,107.2 98.6,105.7 100.5,104.4 102.5,103.1 104.5,101.8 106.5,100.7 108.5,99.6 110.4,98.7 112.4,97.8 114.4,97.0 116.4,96.2 118.3,95.6 120.3,95.0 122.3,94.5 124.3,94.1 126.3,93.8 128.2,93.6 130.2,93.4 132.2,93.3 134.2,93.3 136.2,93.4 138.1,93.6 140.1,93.9 142.1,94.2 144.1,94.6 146.0,95.1 148.0,95.7 150.0,96.3 152.0,97.1 154.0,97.9 155.9,98.8 157.9,99.8 159.9,100.9 161.9,102.0 163.8,103.2 165.8,104.5 167.8,105.9 169.8,107.4 171.8,109.0 173.7,110.6 175.7,112.3 177.7,114.1 179.7,116.0 181.7,118.0 183.6,120.0 185.6,122.2 187.6,124.4 189.6,126.7 191.5,124.3 193.5,121.8 195.5,119.3 197.5,116.7 199.5,114.0 201.4,111.2 203.4,108.3 205.4,105.4 207.4,102.4 209.3,99.3 211.3,96.1 213.3,92.8 215.3,89.4 217.3,86.0 219.2,82.5 221.2,78.9 223.2,75.2 225.2,71.4 227.2,67.6 229.1,63.7 231.1,59.7 233.1,55.6 235.1,51.4 237.0,47.1 239.0,42.8 241.0,38.4 243.0,33.9 245.0,29.3 246.9,24.7 248.9,19.9 250.9,15.1 252.9,10.2 254.8,5.2 256.8,0.1 258.8,-5.0 260.8,-10.3 262.8,-15.6 264.7,-21.0 266.7,-26.4 268.7,-32.0' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='76.5' cy='126.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='64.5' y='140.7'>0</text><circle cx='189.6' cy='126.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='193.6' y='140.7'>2</text><circle cx='133.0' cy='93.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='119.0' y='83.3'>(1,1)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 126.7H294.0M76.5 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='133.0' y1='123.7' x2='133.0' y2='129.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='130.0' y='140.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='246.1' y1='123.7' x2='246.1' y2='129.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='243.1' y='140.7' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='73.5' y1='93.3' x2='79.5' y2='93.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='60.5' y='97.3' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='73.5' y1='60.0' x2='79.5' y2='60.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='60.5' y='64.0' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La gráfica corta al eje en \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=2\\), y entre ellos es positiva:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^2(2x-x^2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[x^2-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_0^2=4-\\frac83=\\frac43\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac43\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
