  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-1-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(I\\) la matriz identidad de orden 2 y \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&m\\\\1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Encuentra los valores de \\(m\\) para los cuales se cumple que \\((A-I)^2=O\\), donde \\(O\\) es la matriz nula de orden 2.",
     "(1,25 p.) Para \\(m=2\\), halla la matriz \\(X\\) tal que \\(AX-2A^T=O\\), donde \\(A^T\\) denota la matriz traspuesta de \\(A\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A-I=\\begin{pmatrix}0&m\\\\1&0\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad(A-I)^2=\\begin{pmatrix}0&m\\\\1&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&m\\\\1&0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}m&0\\\\0&m\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>Es la matriz nula si y solo si \\(m=0\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(m=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(AX=2A^T\\). \\(|A|=1-2=-1\\neq0\\), así que \\(A\\) tiene inversa y \\(X=2A^{-1}A^T\\):</p>\\[A^{-1}=\\frac1{|A|}(\\operatorname{Adj}A)^t=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 2\\\\1 & -1\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad A^T=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 1\\\\2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=2\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 2\\\\1 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 1\\\\2 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=2\\begin{pmatrix}3 & 1\\\\-1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}6 & 2\\\\-2 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}6 & 2\\\\-2 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "ops",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "ecmat",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2007-RESERVA_1.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2007-reserva-1-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Halla los dos puntos que dividen al segmento de extremos \\(A(1,2,1)\\) y \\(B(-1,0,3)\\) en tres partes iguales.",
     "(1,25 p.) Determina la ecuación del plano perpendicular al segmento \\(AB\\) que pasa por su punto medio."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-2,-2,2),\\qquad\\tfrac13\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\left(-\\tfrac23,-\\tfrac23,\\tfrac23\\right)\\]\\[P=A+\\tfrac13\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\left(\\tfrac13,\\tfrac43,\\tfrac53\\right),\\qquad Q=A+\\tfrac23\\overrightarrow{AB}=\\left(-\\tfrac13,\\tfrac23,\\tfrac73\\right)\\]<div class='res'>\\(P\\left(\\dfrac13,\\dfrac43,\\dfrac53\\right)\\) y \\(Q\\left(-\\dfrac13,\\dfrac23,\\dfrac73\\right)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Punto medio \\(M=\\left(\\frac{1-1}2,\\frac{2+0}2,\\frac{1+3}2\\right)=(0,1,2)\\). El plano es perpendicular a \\(AB\\): su normal es \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\parallel(1,1,-1)\\), y es de la forma \\(x+y-z+D=0\\). Contiene a \\(M\\): \\(0+1-2+D=0\\iff D=1\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":33,\"el\":8,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-0.149,2.058,2.908],[1.808,0.101,2.908],[0.649,-1.058,0.592],[-1.308,0.899,0.592]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[0.649,-1.058,0.592],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[1,2,1],[-1,0,3],\"#2f6df0\",2.2,false],[\"pt\",[1,2,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,0,3],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0.333,1.333,1.667],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-0.333,0.667,2.333],\"Q\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1,2],\"M\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m07r1a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m07r1a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m07r1a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m07r1a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='304.3,49.6 57.1,56.9 26.0,246.0 273.2,238.7' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.0' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='242.7' y1='234.0' x2='189.0' y2='18.0' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2.2'/><circle cx='242.7' cy='234.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='249.7' y='228.0' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='189.0' cy='18.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='196.0' y='12.0' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='224.8' cy='162.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='231.8' y='156.0' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='206.9' cy='90.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='213.9' y='84.0' font-weight='700'>Q</text><circle cx='215.9' cy='126.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='222.9' y='120.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='15.3' y2='271.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='9.2' y='276.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='37.4' y2='271.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='39.1' y='275.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='252.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(x+y-z+1=0\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "geom",
