   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:(-1,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\ln(x+1)\\) (\\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Determina la ecuación de la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=0\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\), la recta tangente obtenida en el apartado anterior y la recta \\(x=1\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f(0)=\\ln1=0,\\qquad f'(x)=\\frac1{x+1}\\Rightarrow f'(0)=1\\]<div class='res'>\\(y=x\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La tangente queda por encima de la gráfica (\\(f''(x)=-\\frac1{(x+1)^2}\\lt0\\): \\(f\\) es cóncava). El recinto va de \\(x=0\\) (punto de tangencia) a \\(x=1\\):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='106.7,121.8 109.4,120.0 112.1,118.2 114.8,116.4 117.5,114.5 120.2,112.7 122.9,110.9 125.6,109.1 128.3,107.3 131.0,105.5 133.8,103.6 136.5,101.8 139.2,100.0 141.9,98.2 144.6,96.4 147.3,94.5 150.0,92.7 152.7,90.9 155.4,89.1 158.1,87.3 160.8,85.5 163.5,83.6 166.2,81.8 169.0,80.0 171.7,78.2 174.4,76.4 177.1,74.5 179.8,72.7 182.5,70.9 185.2,69.1 187.9,67.3 190.6,65.5 193.3,63.6 196.0,61.8 198.7,60.0 201.5,58.2 204.2,56.4 206.9,54.5 209.6,52.7 212.3,50.9 215.0,49.1 215.0,71.4 212.3,72.3 209.6,73.2 206.9,74.2 204.2,75.1 201.5,76.1 198.7,77.1 196.0,78.1 193.3,79.1 190.6,80.1 187.9,81.1 185.2,82.2 182.5,83.2 179.8,84.3 177.1,85.4 174.4,86.5 171.7,87.6 169.0,88.8 166.2,89.9 163.5,91.1 160.8,92.3 158.1,93.6 155.4,94.8 152.7,96.1 150.0,97.3 147.3,98.7 144.6,100.0 141.9,101.4 139.2,102.7 136.5,104.1 133.8,105.6 131.0,107.1 128.3,108.6 125.6,110.1 122.9,111.7 120.2,113.3 117.5,114.9 114.8,116.6 112.1,118.3 109.4,120.0 106.7,121.8' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='41.7,188.5 44.5,183.8 47.4,179.5 50.2,175.4 53.0,171.5 55.9,167.8 58.7,164.3 61.6,161.0 64.4,157.8 67.3,154.7 70.1,151.8 72.9,148.9 75.8,146.2 78.6,143.6 81.5,141.1 84.3,138.6 87.2,136.3 90.0,134.0 92.9,131.7 95.7,129.6 98.5,127.5 101.4,125.5 104.2,123.5 107.1,121.5 109.9,119.7 112.8,117.8 115.6,116.1 118.4,114.3 121.3,112.6 124.1,110.9 127.0,109.3 129.8,107.7 132.7,106.2 135.5,104.7 138.4,103.2 141.2,101.7 144.0,100.3 146.9,98.9 149.7,97.5 152.6,96.1 155.4,94.8 158.3,93.5 161.1,92.2 163.9,90.9 166.8,89.7 169.6,88.5 172.5,87.3 175.3,86.1 178.2,85.0 181.0,83.8 183.9,82.7 186.7,81.6 189.5,80.5 192.4,79.4 195.2,78.4 198.1,77.3 200.9,76.3 203.8,75.3 206.6,74.3 209.4,73.3 212.3,72.3 215.1,71.4 218.0,70.4 220.8,69.5 223.7,68.6 226.5,67.6 229.4,66.7 232.2,65.9 235.0,65.0 237.9,64.1 240.7,63.2 243.6,62.4 246.4,61.6 249.3,60.7 252.1,59.9 254.9,59.1 257.8,58.3 260.6,57.5 263.5,56.7 266.3,55.9 269.2,55.2' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='30.8,172.7 139.2,100.0 247.5,27.3' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='215.0' y1='180.0' x2='215.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><text x='231.2' y='69.5' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='10'>ln(x+1)</text><text x='171.7' y='49.1' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y=x</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 121.8H294.0M106.7 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='215.0' y1='118.8' x2='215.0' y2='124.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='212.0' y='135.8' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='103.7' y1='49.1' x2='109.7' y2='49.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='90.7' y='53.1' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div><p>Una primitiva de \\(\\ln(x+1)\\), por partes<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i> con \\(u=\\ln(x+1)\\), \\(dv=dx\\): \\(x\\ln(x+1)-\\int\\frac x{x+1}dx=(x+1)\\ln(x+1)-x\\).</p>\\[A=\\int_0^1\\bigl(x-\\ln(x+1)\\bigr)dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{x^2}2-(x+1)\\ln(x+1)+x\\Bigr]_0^1=\\frac12-2\\ln2+1=\\frac32-2\\ln2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac32-2\\ln2\\approx0{,}114\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
